# Ktor / coroutines / serialization
-dontwarn org.slf4j.**
-dontwarn io.netty.**
-dontwarn java.lang.management.**
-dontwarn javax.naming.**
-dontwarn com.typesafe.config.**
-keep class io.ktor.server.cio.** { *; }
-keep class io.ktor.server.engine.** { *; }
